//               loans left out could move it ("partial": under 80% of the
//               debt cost or fair value marked, or a left-out loan on
//               non-accrual). Never fair value ÷ cost, never equity over par.
// equity_cost / equity_fv  preferred, common, warrants, units, fund and
//               CLO-equity interests: shown as value vs cost, never in cents.
// is_non_accrual / has_pik  over the debt rows only (0/1, null when the
//               holder has no debt or the status was not read); equity_na is
//               1 when a preferred or other non-debt row is on non-accrual,
//               equity_pik (present only when 1) when one pays in kind.
